            "text": "In his 2022 campaign, he stated he was a renter in a rent-controlled unit.",
            "cites": [2]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As board chair, he helped implement Measure RC, which banned banked rent increases and increased the amount tenants can recover in landlord disputes. In 2026, he voted to withdraw the Rent Control Board's recommendation for a ballot measure that included extra occupant protections. He told the Los Angeles Daily News that as a councilmember he would push to expand emergency rental assistance, the Preserving our Diversity rental subsidy, right-to-counsel for tenants, and enforcement of the short-term rental ordinance to preserve housing for residents.",
